tools.description:
Apply hash-bound source-instance SVGs to a new canonical review package.

    This preserves CAD database bytes and produces candidate review projects;
    it does not accept a semantic interpretation or an OSM matching revision.

file_url.description:
Public https:// URL of the file (e.g. a cloud share or export link);
the server downloads it (15 MiB cap). Provide exactly one of
`file_url`, `upload_id` or `file_base64`.

spec.description:
Target spec, camelCase JSON. Shape varies by type:

Slack:
{ "name": "...", "type": "slack", "endpoint": "https://hooks.slack.com/..." }

Generic webhook:
{ "name": "...", "type": "webhook", "endpoint": "https://...", "headers": {...}, "skipTlsCheck": false }

Alertmanager:
{ "name": "...", "type": "alertManager", "endpoint": "https://...", "skipTlsCheck": false, "username": "...", "password": "..." }

Optional on all: { "notificationConfig": { "interval": 60 } }

Reference: https://www.parseable.com/docs/user-guide/alerting
